WEBVTT

00:00:07.827 --> 00:00:10.204
Yatter Metropolis…

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.960
Absent-minded, I only prayed to the stars

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:40.760
Losing sight of all that was precious

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:45.600
Absent-minded, I kept my eyes fixed on the same spot

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:51.310
And came to a standstill myself

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:56.480
We don't need no reasons

00:00:58.610 --> 00:01:01.570
To change for the better

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:08.870
Now, let's dream to the extreme

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:10.960
You're a shooting star

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:14.250
Kick open the doors that stand in your way

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:19.470
And leap beyond the infinite horizon

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:21.550
Light on the shooting star

00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:27.560
Don't look back; what you seek is in front of you

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.680
Let's go in search of it

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:35.440
Fly away

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.130
Yatter, Yatter, Yatterman!

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:56.386
Thus, Yatterman defeated the
villainous group of thieves, Doronbow,

00:01:56.386 --> 00:02:04.978
with its members, Dokurobey,
Doronjo, Boyacky, and Tonzra.

00:02:04.978 --> 00:02:09.482
The war ended and the world was saved!

00:02:09.482 --> 00:02:12.110
Everyone lived happily ever after.

00:02:15.655 --> 00:02:21.369
I used to adore Lord and
Lady Yatterman as heroes.

00:02:21.369 --> 00:02:23.163
I was drawn to Yatter Kingdom,

00:02:23.163 --> 00:02:29.711
thinking that it was a heavenly place
that was beautiful and rich.

00:02:29.711 --> 00:02:31.963
But I was wrong.

00:02:33.298 --> 00:02:35.592
This place is hell.

00:02:35.592 --> 00:02:40.013
I always thought that I was going to live
like a zombie in the depths of despair,

00:02:40.013 --> 00:02:43.975
forever being frightened
by the shadow of Yatterman.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:00.366
But I couldn’t take it anymore.

00:03:00.366 --> 00:03:04.120
I was sad because my mom went to heaven.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:09.375
So I just had to at least give
Yatterman a piece of my mind.

00:03:10.543 --> 00:03:13.087
We felt the same.

00:03:13.087 --> 00:03:17.634
Half out of desperation,
we marched into Yatter Kingdom.

00:03:17.634 --> 00:03:21.888
We thought that we’d let
Miss Leopard do whatever she wanted.

00:03:21.888 --> 00:03:23.973
After Lady Dorothy was gone,

00:03:23.973 --> 00:03:29.312
maybe we thought we were
okay with dying ourselves.

00:03:29.312 --> 00:03:30.730
But…

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:33.900
You guys were a beacon of hope.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:37.654
In this dark world of deep night,

00:03:37.654 --> 00:03:42.408
though you were a tiny,
tiny light, still, you were shining.

00:03:42.408 --> 00:03:44.160
Although Ally was a ways crying,

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:46.579
she smiled for the first time
when you guys showed up.

00:03:46.579 --> 00:03:50.416
That’s why I thought
I wanted us to go with you.

00:03:51.876 --> 00:03:56.506
Miss Doronjo always stays positive.

00:03:56.506 --> 00:04:00.593
She can get angry, worry, and cry for others.

00:04:00.635 --> 00:04:04.138
And she always laughs so loudly.

00:04:04.138 --> 00:04:10.979
I love hearing Doronjo’s laugh. She’s my angel.

00:04:10.979 --> 00:04:15.566
Whether we can really bring down
Yatterman or not isn’t important.

00:04:15.566 --> 00:04:20.071
Well, of course, if we can,
that would be the best,

00:04:20.113 --> 00:04:25.368
but just being with Doronjo makes
me feel like a bright future awaits us.

00:04:25.368 --> 00:04:29.706
We no longer feel that it’s okay if we die.

00:04:29.706 --> 00:04:33.042
That’s right. We won’t die no matter what.

00:04:33.042 --> 00:04:36.296
We’ll protect Miss Doronjo
all the way without fail.

00:04:36.337 --> 00:04:37.797
There’s nothing to worry about.

00:04:37.797 --> 00:04:42.135
We’ve got our hero, Yatterman.

00:04:42.135 --> 00:04:48.016
As long as Yatterman exists,
evil will have no place in this world.

00:04:48.016 --> 00:04:52.687
Yatterman is a damned fool!

00:04:53.771 --> 00:04:57.442
Traveling Yatter Kingdom
has made me clearly realize that

00:04:57.442 --> 00:05:02.822
Great Dokurobey and my ancestor were
trying to do the right thing. I'm sure of it.

00:05:02.822 --> 00:05:06.701
They must’ve thought that Yatterman was evil,
and therefore needed to be brought down.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:12.790
Yatterman! Just wait and see!

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:18.755
Everyone’s hero, Doronbow,
is coming to bring you down!

00:05:25.261 --> 00:05:27.221
Miss Doronjo…

00:05:27.221 --> 00:05:29.766
The time has come.

00:05:29.766 --> 00:05:32.393
We’ve come a long way, oink.

00:05:32.393 --> 00:05:35.271
Yeah, we have.

00:05:35.271 --> 00:05:39.442
I’ll be able to see my mom, dad, and dog soon.

00:05:39.442 --> 00:05:41.069
Yeah…

00:05:41.669 --> 00:05:45.039
So…

00:05:45.239 --> 00:05:46.449
"So"?

00:05:46.449 --> 00:05:48.368
What’s our plan?

00:05:48.368 --> 00:05:52.288
Well… uhm… first…

00:05:52.288 --> 00:05:54.332
I think…

00:05:54.332 --> 00:05:58.044
…that’s where Yatterman is.

00:05:58.044 --> 00:06:00.380
How about this? We wait until it’s dark.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.549
Then we enter the city,
evading Yatter soldiers on the watch,

00:06:03.549 --> 00:06:06.386
and head to that place.

00:06:06.386 --> 00:06:09.138
We’ll check what’s going on
inside the city at the same time.

00:06:09.138 --> 00:06:12.683
I-I was about to say the same thing!

00:06:12.683 --> 00:06:15.144
My, my… Gatchan is completely…

00:06:15.144 --> 00:06:17.688
…acting as a leader.

00:06:18.648 --> 00:06:20.358
Listen, guys!

00:06:20.358 --> 00:06:23.694
We’ll head there while
collecting information!

00:06:23.694 --> 00:06:25.988
Gatchan suggested it just now.

00:06:25.988 --> 00:06:28.157
Exactly the same thing.

00:06:28.157 --> 00:06:29.575
Got that?!

00:06:29.575 --> 00:06:32.078
Yes, ma’am!

00:06:32.078 --> 00:06:35.998
Yo-ho! Yo-ho! Yo-ho! Yo-ho!

00:06:35.998 --> 00:06:43.923
Yo-ho! Yo-ho! Yo-ho! Yo-ho! Yo-ho!

00:06:43.923 --> 00:06:47.718
--Yo-ho! Yo-ho! Yo-ho! Yo-ho!
--The wind feels good, doesn’t it, piggy?

00:07:13.494 --> 00:07:16.289
It’s the same everywhere.

00:07:16.289 --> 00:07:19.417
Yeah, everywhere we go…

00:07:19.417 --> 00:07:22.628
it’ a dark world… It’s hell!

00:07:30.219 --> 00:07:32.180
No one’s around?

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:34.474
It appears that way.

00:07:34.474 --> 00:07:36.476
What’s going on?

00:07:38.436 --> 00:07:39.896
That’s…

00:07:53.659 --> 00:07:55.495
It smells kinda bad.

00:07:55.495 --> 00:07:58.122
The air here seems unhealthy.

00:07:58.122 --> 00:08:00.333
It must be harmful.

00:08:01.626 --> 00:08:02.627
Miss Doronjo!

00:08:02.627 --> 00:08:03.836
Did they find us?!

00:08:03.836 --> 00:08:05.338
We gotta get out of here!

00:08:05.338 --> 00:08:07.173
Oh no! They’re ambitious and accomplished!

00:08:07.173 --> 00:08:09.634
No, it doesn’t appear that way.

00:08:15.264 --> 00:08:21.145
You’re done for the day.
You’re done for the day.

00:08:21.145 --> 00:08:25.191
Appreciate Great Lord Yatterman
for giving you work.

00:08:25.191 --> 00:08:27.026
Yatterman!

00:08:28.194 --> 00:08:30.238
Yatterman.

00:08:32.073 --> 00:08:34.116
Move forward!

00:08:34.116 --> 00:08:37.995
Yatter… Yatter… Yatter…

00:08:37.995 --> 00:08:40.831
Why are they obeying like that?

00:08:42.083 --> 00:08:44.335
Great Lord Yatterman!

00:08:44.335 --> 00:08:45.878
Wh-What now?

00:08:45.878 --> 00:08:47.588
Doronjo, look over there.

00:08:47.588 --> 00:08:51.008
Great Lord Yatterman works
his fingers to the bone every day

00:08:51.008 --> 00:08:55.137
for the glory of us,
the people of Yatter Kingdom!

00:08:51.008 --> 00:09:02.186
Remember. That detestable,
atrocious group of thieves Doronbow,

00:09:02.186 --> 00:09:05.982
once stole the beautiful moon of all things...

00:09:11.773 --> 00:09:14.222
...and threw innocent people
into an abyss fear.

00:09:15.157 --> 00:09:19.537
And still their thieving did not stop!
They tried to steel everything away from us.

00:09:19.579 --> 00:09:24.208
Not even weeds grew
where Doronbow had been.

00:09:24.208 --> 00:09:28.963
However! Our Lord and Lady Yatterman
never allow evil to exist!

00:09:29.005 --> 00:09:32.925
After a fierce war
they defeated Dokurobey.

00:09:32.925 --> 00:09:36.429
Yatter! Yatter! Yatterman!

00:09:36.429 --> 00:09:40.266
Lord and Lady Yatterman,
our shining hope, founded Yatter Kingdom

00:09:40.266 --> 00:09:45.021
in order to protect us from
the negative legacy of the war.

00:09:45.021 --> 00:09:49.609
And, in order to lead us to the glorious future,

00:09:49.609 --> 00:09:55.781
they’ve been living for a long, long time,
without even being allowed to die!

00:09:55.865 --> 00:09:59.577
Lord and Lady Yatterman exist solely for us!

00:09:59.577 --> 00:10:03.289
We work in order to create
a peaceful, affluent world

00:10:03.289 --> 00:10:07.376
as well as to greet the coming bright future!

00:10:07.376 --> 00:10:09.629
Take delight in labor!

00:10:09.629 --> 00:10:13.507
Appreciate Lord Yatterman for giving you work!

00:10:13.507 --> 00:10:17.303
You should all take delight in labor!

00:10:17.303 --> 00:10:19.847
Yatterman is our hero!

00:10:19.847 --> 00:10:26.145
Yatter! Yatter! Yatterman!

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:34.195
Remember. That detestable,
atrocious group of thieves, Doronbow--

00:10:34.195 --> 00:10:37.490
Great Lord and Lady Yatterman, my butt!

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:39.158
That was full of lies!

00:10:41.786 --> 00:10:43.454
You’re loud!

00:10:43.454 --> 00:10:48.084
They make people believe that
Yatterman is wonderful and a hero.

00:10:48.084 --> 00:10:50.920
That’s why people think
that they have no choice.

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:55.716
Because Yatterman saved the
world from the war, they think.

00:10:55.716 --> 00:10:57.677
"Without even being allowed to die"?

00:10:57.677 --> 00:11:00.346
That’s a weird thing to say.

00:11:00.346 --> 00:11:04.892
I thought that Yatterman was a name
passed down from generation to generation.

00:11:04.892 --> 00:11:06.686
Was I mistaken?

00:11:06.686 --> 00:11:09.605
No one lives forever.

00:11:09.605 --> 00:11:11.899
Yeah…

00:11:11.899 --> 00:11:15.528
Maybe they’re now complete
cyborg like Yatter soldiers?

00:11:15.528 --> 00:11:18.864
If that’s the case, it’s understandable, but…

00:11:22.034 --> 00:11:24.870
G-Gatchan…

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.163
Uhm…

00:11:26.163 --> 00:11:27.832
Could you let go of me?

00:11:27.832 --> 00:11:29.959
Oh, sure.

00:11:29.959 --> 00:11:32.336
Gatchan is daring.

00:11:32.336 --> 00:11:34.046
Are you okay, Ally?

00:11:34.046 --> 00:11:35.965
Hm? Yeah.

00:11:39.301 --> 00:11:42.388
Every single thing they say is a lie.

00:11:42.388 --> 00:11:45.349
Yatter Kingdom is full of lies.

00:11:45.349 --> 00:11:47.309
They make people suffer…

00:11:47.309 --> 00:11:51.063
We really have to bring down Yatterman.

00:11:51.063 --> 00:11:55.568
We’ll bring him down…
We’ll force him off of the throne.

00:11:55.568 --> 00:11:59.613
And then, what…?
Suppose we did bring him down…

00:11:59.613 --> 00:12:02.408
What are we going to do with those people?

00:12:02.408 --> 00:12:08.748
Yatter… Yatter… Yatter… Yatter…

00:12:08.748 --> 00:12:13.461
We can figure it out later. We first
have to bring down Yatterman.

00:12:13.461 --> 00:12:14.795
Let’s go!

00:12:22.386 --> 00:12:23.929
Are you okay, Alouette?

00:12:23.929 --> 00:12:25.931
I'm fine.

00:12:25.931 --> 00:12:28.267
What about you, Doronjo?

00:12:28.267 --> 00:12:30.936
I'm… okay, too.

00:12:41.238 --> 00:12:45.993
It’s quite bright for some reason.

00:12:45.993 --> 00:12:49.413
They work the people like slaves…

00:12:49.413 --> 00:12:54.168
but Yatterman is…
but Yatterman is…

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:13.604
We’re the twelve generals
who serve Lord Yatterman,

00:13:13.604 --> 00:13:18.442
who fight for Lord Yatterman,
and who protect Lord Yatterman.

00:13:18.442 --> 00:13:21.487
We’re called the Twelve Yatter Guardian Gods!

00:13:21.487 --> 00:13:23.489
The Twelve Yatter Guardian Gods?!

00:13:23.489 --> 00:13:24.865
One, two, three…

00:13:24.865 --> 00:13:26.826
There are only eleven of them.

00:13:26.826 --> 00:13:31.330
Thanks to you, we lost General Goro, so…

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.709
I'm General Ichiro!

00:13:35.709 --> 00:13:37.503
I'm General Jiro!

00:13:37.503 --> 00:13:39.421
I'm General Saburo.

00:13:39.421 --> 00:13:40.798
I'm General Shiro.

00:13:40.798 --> 00:13:42.383
I'm General Rokuro.

00:13:42.383 --> 00:13:43.342
I'm Nana.

00:13:43.342 --> 00:13:45.719
I'm General Hachi-Yellow.

00:13:45.719 --> 00:13:46.679
I'm General Kyuro.

00:13:46.679 --> 00:13:47.680
I'm General Jura.

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:48.681
I'm General Juichiro.

00:13:48.681 --> 00:13:50.140
I'm General Juniro.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:52.726
We are the Twelve Yatter Guardian Gods!

00:13:52.726 --> 00:13:54.687
The Twelve Yatter Guardian Gods?!

00:13:54.687 --> 00:13:57.398
So what do the Twelve
Yatter Guardian Gods want?

00:13:57.398 --> 00:14:00.985
What else? In the name of Lord Yatterman,

00:14:00.985 --> 00:14:03.571
we’ll severely punish you.

00:14:03.571 --> 00:14:05.531
Be prepared.

00:14:05.531 --> 00:14:08.409
Here we go! Yatterman!

00:14:08.409 --> 00:14:10.160
Yatterman!

00:14:20.095 --> 00:14:21.805
Yatterman!

00:14:33.859 --> 00:14:35.360
Miss Doronjo!

00:14:37.904 --> 00:14:40.574
--We’re not gonna let you get away!
--That’s useless resistance.

00:14:40.574 --> 00:14:42.868
Now… this is it for you.

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:53.295
They’re attacking us from both sides!

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:56.131
Miss Doronjo!

00:14:56.131 --> 00:14:58.216
We have no choice but to fight!

00:14:58.216 --> 00:14:59.676
O-Okay.

00:14:59.676 --> 00:15:01.928
Capture the rebels.

00:15:01.928 --> 00:15:05.974
Yatter!

00:15:05.974 --> 00:15:07.476
Yatterman!

00:15:14.483 --> 00:15:16.526
Yatter?! Yatter?! Yatter?!

00:15:16.526 --> 00:15:21.656
Miss Doronjo! Good job blinding them!

00:15:25.911 --> 00:15:28.163
Don’t come closer, you bastards!

00:15:28.163 --> 00:15:30.457
Take this!

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:44.012
Boyacky! Isn’t it ready yet?!

00:15:44.012 --> 00:15:46.765
P-Please wait a bit longer!

00:15:46.765 --> 00:15:49.267
Say, piggy, don’t you feel hungry?

00:15:49.267 --> 00:15:50.936
This isn’t the time for that, oink!

00:15:50.936 --> 00:15:54.814
Yatter!

00:16:16.503 --> 00:16:21.049
Let go of me! You damned fools!

00:16:21.049 --> 00:16:22.884
Leave Ally alone!

00:16:22.884 --> 00:16:25.011
We’re vastly outnumbered.

00:16:25.011 --> 00:16:27.305
How dirty you fight!

00:16:27.305 --> 00:16:31.268
Fight me one-on-one!

00:16:41.570 --> 00:16:42.696
Piggy?

00:16:42.696 --> 00:16:46.241
Let go of me, oink!
What’re you gonna do, oink?!

00:16:52.622 --> 00:16:54.416
What an easy task.

00:16:54.416 --> 00:17:01.339
Seriously, what the heck was Goro doing,
taking so long to capture them?

00:17:01.339 --> 00:17:05.552
Capturing Doronbow was a piece of cake.

00:17:05.552 --> 00:17:07.470
Take them away.

00:17:21.234 --> 00:17:24.779
Rebels who go against Lord Yatterman…

00:17:24.779 --> 00:17:27.532
Let’s hear what you
have to say before you die.

00:17:32.662 --> 00:17:36.666
I’ll never… ever give up!

00:17:36.666 --> 00:17:38.793
I’ll never give up!

00:17:38.793 --> 00:17:40.712
Okay, you’re done.

00:17:41.796 --> 00:17:45.467
Boyacky, what are your last words?

00:17:45.467 --> 00:17:50.930
My last words… The outcry of my soul…

00:17:54.142 --> 00:18:01.107
Every one of the high school girls
throughout the country! I won’t die!

00:18:01.107 --> 00:18:02.734
"High school girls"?

00:18:02.734 --> 00:18:04.486
What’s he talking about?

00:18:04.486 --> 00:18:08.073
I don’t know, but that’s my overflowing libido!

00:18:08.073 --> 00:18:09.491
Okay, next.

00:18:13.995 --> 00:18:18.958
If I had known this’d happen, I would’ve
eaten him, instead of holding back!

00:18:18.958 --> 00:18:21.336
What’d you say, oink?!

00:18:26.633 --> 00:18:28.677
Don’t bother with him.

00:18:32.847 --> 00:18:38.436
I… I won’t give up, either! Never!

00:18:38.436 --> 00:18:40.689
That’s right! I won’t give up, either!

00:18:40.689 --> 00:18:42.857
I won’t give up!

00:18:45.568 --> 00:18:48.154
We’ll start the punishment now!

00:18:48.154 --> 00:18:49.364
Five!

00:18:49.364 --> 00:18:50.532
Four!

00:18:50.532 --> 00:18:51.908
Three!

00:18:51.908 --> 00:18:55.203
One!

00:18:59.791 --> 00:19:02.836
That’s… a Yatter message!

00:19:02.836 --> 00:19:05.255
It’s from Lord Yatterman!

00:19:05.255 --> 00:19:07.257
What does it say?

00:19:07.257 --> 00:19:08.883
I wanna know.

00:19:10.301 --> 00:19:11.594
What?!

00:19:21.896 --> 00:19:24.399
I wonder where they’re taking us…

00:19:24.399 --> 00:19:27.569
ln any case, it doesn’t look like
we’ll be punished right away.

00:19:36.536 --> 00:19:38.455
--Hey.
--Yes, sir!

00:19:41.374 --> 00:19:44.794
--Where’re you taking us?!
--I wonder what "high school girls" mean.

00:19:44.794 --> 00:19:45.628
--Honorable Oda! Listen to me!
--l refuse to hear it, oink!

00:19:45.628 --> 00:19:52.218
--l’ll see my mom, dad, and dog soon!

00:19:52.218 --> 00:19:54.429
Don’t speak all at the same time.

00:19:54.429 --> 00:19:56.681
We can’t make out
what you’re saying at all.

00:19:56.681 --> 00:19:59.434
What’re you going to do with us?!

00:19:59.434 --> 00:20:02.812
Lord Yatterman will see you.

00:20:02.812 --> 00:20:04.272
Yatterman will?!

00:20:04.272 --> 00:20:07.192
What’s gotten into him?

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:13.823
This is my chance!
I'm gonna complain big time.

00:20:13.823 --> 00:20:18.620
I'm gonna complain for my mom and
my ancestors, too! I’ll air all my complaints!

00:20:22.624 --> 00:20:26.544
Welcome, the Doronbow group!

00:20:27.712 --> 00:20:28.797
Huh?

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:41.893
Miss Doronjo! Look!

00:20:43.144 --> 00:20:47.524
That portrait… Our ancestors’… Wh-Why?

00:20:47.524 --> 00:20:49.984
What the heck is going on?

00:20:49.984 --> 00:20:54.656
Lord Yatterman will grace
you with his presence now!

00:20:54.656 --> 00:20:57.158
Yatter! Yatter! Yatterman!

00:20:57.158 --> 00:21:01.496
